# Falsifiability (tri-split reshape): a WorkUnit admitted with a charge exceeding the
# remaining token capacity at admission must violate the deployed-policy invariant.
@prefix ciops: <https://oip.law/ontology/ci-ops#> .
ciops:wu-big ciops:admittedBy ciops:g-over .
ciops:g-over ciops:admissionChargeTokens 5 ;
    ciops:capacityAtAdmissionTokens 3 .
